# The Train_results_<strategy> notebooks run scripts/analyze_repair_strategies.py,
# which regenerates ~18 files per strategy here on every run. We only commit the two
# summary CSVs the notebooks read (and that teammates use to sanity-check their
# strategy's numbers). Everything else is reproducible scratch and is ignored.

# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...except the folders and the two summary CSVs we want tracked.
!*/
!overall_summary.csv
!mechanism_summary.csv
!.gitignore
